  <!-- Hardware Notes -->
  (text "PCA9685 HARDWARE NOTES:\n1. A0-A5 strapped to GND -> I2C address 0x40.\n2. ALLCALL mode disabled in software at startup to avoid I2C broadcast lockups.\n3. /OE (Pin 23) active LOW. When HIGH, all outputs are tristated to high-Z."
    (at 50.8 165.1 0)
